3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9zh1zBCNwAillMzWrwtSMP9rlvbmH_b3CLBeeO6M0YWQ&oe=6A22EB05"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1282607363503937", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619450_1282607370170603_4336778924990374554_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4QqPW0A5TooQ7kNvwFbePDV&_nc_oc=Adqkfbsw4rWdGWfwfQ6aeRYZYWvGsoyqAdeBF47NPqLRnnK3zG0qPkCRbdJXF0zS8YI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af87oLa3Shgw3cLnGN84l16YU_UYjSKGgguoUSzzKLrexw&oe=6A22DB86"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bowling VR Club: Strike Arena", "keywords": ["bowlingvr", "vrbowlinggame", "bowlingsimulator", "3dbowlinggame", "bowlinggamevr"], "long_description": "Bowling VR Club: Strike Arena is an immersive VR bowling experience designed for realistic 3D physics and competitive strike gameplay. Step into a dynamic bowling world where precision, timing, and skill define every throw.\n\nExperience realistic bowling mechanics with advanced 3D physics that make every strike feel authentic. Join the bowling club and compete in exciting strike arenas built for challenge and progression. Each lane offers a new level of intensity as you improve your aim, master spin control, and chase perfect games.\n\nPlay in beautifully designed VR environments that bring the atmosphere of real bowling alleys into virtual reality. Whether you are a casual player or a competitive bowler, the game offers smooth gameplay, engaging challenges, and endless replay value.\n\nBecome the ultimate strike champion in Bowling VR Club: Strike Arena and master the art of precision bowling in VR.", "short_description": "VR bowling game with 3D physics, realistic strike gameplay, and 3d bowling club competition in immersive strike arenas."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/fun-soft/privacy-policy-meta-quest", "developer_terms_of_service_url": nu